flowchart TD
    A[User Request] --> B[Intake & Scope Clarification]
    B --> C[Report Plan + Initial ToC]
    C --> D[Research Query Plan]
    D --> E[Retrieve Sources]
    E --> F[Source Quality Filter]
    F --> G{Enough Evidence?}
    G -- No --> D
    G -- Yes --> H[Evidence Matrix]
    H --> I[Draft Report]
    I --> J[Generate Diagrams, Tables, Examples]
    J --> K[Quality Scoring]
    K --> L{Score >= 90 and No Hard Fail?}
    L -- No --> M[Evaluator Feedback + Revision Plan]
    M --> I
    L -- Yes --> N[Final Report Package]
